  "text": "Intake note (Commercial team, 15 November 2020). Our client Pooja Pai is a 47-year-old mechanical engineer who lives at House No. 170, Mavoor Road, Kozhikode 673001 and can be reached on +91 75476 01413 or pooja.pai@example.in. The client's PAN QTWPP6832G.\nThe client consulted us about a cheque bounce matter against Coastal Enterprises. A cheque for 17.9 lakh rupees issued by M/s Coastal Enterprises bounced: the cheque came back with the remark account closed.\nThe cheque was deposited in the client's account no. 278535092770 (IFSC SBIN0861538).\nThe matter was filed as CC/2485/2021 before the Judicial Magistrate First Class Court at Kozhikode on 28 February 2021.",
